    "body": "Stopped before claiming. This issue explicitly follows the catalog infrastructure in #2393.\n\nUpstream/main 3e47b898b0148727979ff4a509f33a742f80ff1d has no examples/catalog directory, crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs, or xtask/src/catalog.rs. The GitHub contents API returns 404 for each path.\n\n#2393 remains open. Its latest comment reports held work on mkinney:issue/2393-example-catalog-infra after two gate failures. There is no open PR for that branch to stack on.\n\nNo open PR overlaps the planned turning/cone-thread case files, example_catalog.rs, or docs/decisions/2394-cone-thread.md. No claim, worktree, source change, test run, or push was made. Resume #2394 after #2393 supplies the required catalog framework or opens an eligible PR to stack on.\n",
